       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SINGLETON.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 REGISTRY.
          05 REGISTRY-COUNT PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       01 DISPLAY-COUNT PIC ZZZ9.
       01 FIRST-INSTANCE USAGE POINTER.
       01 SECOND-INSTANCE USAGE POINTER.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           SET FIRST-INSTANCE TO ADDRESS OF REGISTRY
           SET SECOND-INSTANCE TO ADDRESS OF REGISTRY
           ADD 1 TO REGISTRY-COUNT
           MOVE REGISTRY-COUNT TO DISPLAY-COUNT
           IF FIRST-INSTANCE = SECOND-INSTANCE
               DISPLAY 'same=true'
           ELSE
               DISPLAY 'same=false'
           END-IF
           DISPLAY 'count=' DISPLAY-COUNT
           STOP RUN.
